╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ hybrid_golomb_sa_v2                                                                       │
│ patch_description        │ This crossover combines the strengths of the two prior programs:                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. From the "Hybrid Golomb + dense-core" program: the structured construction             │
│                          │ `_build_dense_golomb` (dense core plus offset Golomb ruler), the `_greedy_golomb`         │
│                          │ builder, and the systematic enumeration of structured constructions in Phase 1. These     │
│                          │ give a strong, diverse set of starting points that already reach a decent score.          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. From the "Greedy + SA" program: the `_greedy_build` heuristic that chooses each new    │
│                          │ element to directly maximize the objective, which explores a complementary region of the  │
│                          │ search space.                                                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new program performs:                                                                 │
│                          │ - Phase 1a: enumerate structured dense-core + Golomb constructions (many combinations of  │
│                          │ core size, Golomb size, and gap).                                                         │
│                          │ - Phase 1b: try pure dense intervals and pure greedy Golomb rulers.                       │
